  "decisions": [
    "Use the authored 20 lb, 80/320, 1d10 piercing, two-handed Repeating 5 crossbow profile; the Soldier kit fixture has an empty magazine and twenty carried bolts.",
    "Reload transfers actual accessible carried bolts, costs the shared Action, and releases one grip as the loading hand in this fixture.",
    "Ordinary attack requires the shared Action, actual held weapon, two hands, explicit trained facts, explicit fixture geometry, a legal living target and at least one loaded bolt.",
    "Legal hit or miss expends one provenance-linked bolt; hit damage uses the source weapon die and existing bounded damage/life resolution.",
    "Save schema22 persists weapon, loaded/available/expended bolt provenance, training facts, attack rolls, damage, life outcomes, receipts and replay state; earlier schemas remain accepted.",
    "Schema24 stores one Bonus Action availability record per shared-calendar actor and regular interval; the next regular start refreshes availability.",
    "Tactical Reposition spends this common ledger while retaining its separate Recharge and movement budget.",
    "The automatic Soldier 1 Base Overwatch entitlement is tagged AutomaticClassFeature, has no selection milestone, and is excluded from selected-card counts. The schema24 Soldier fixture does not claim to satisfy the four-card/two-active level-1 selection schedule.",
    "Schema21-23 serialized grant layout and legacy feature runtime remain versioned unchanged; schema24 appends grant origin and the shared Bonus Action ledger."
  ],
