  "limits": [
    "Fixed two-actor tactical calendar, one Soldier Overwatch owner, one Repeating-crossbow profile and one actual bolt lot.",
    "The 3-by-3 five-foot zone, known visibility, cardinal firing lane and Push save modifier are explicit TEST_ONLY fixture facts.",
    "Only completed movement entry/inside-zone triggers execute. Hostile attack-from-zone is rejected for the zone owner; reveal triggers are excluded.",
    "Push is restricted to cardinal firing lanes and known fixed-grid blockers; Staggered is unsupported.",
    "Ordinary condition-remover invocation, full Soldier 1 loadout, general visibility, general weapon/reaction catalogs, cooperative play and release approval remain incomplete.",
    "Headless Roslyn and static package checks are not Unity compilation, editor/play-mode, build or gameplay qualification.",
    "Command discovery and costs are transient; only the existing crossbow command types are query-enabled. The headless controller is a harness, not production AI. Unity import and runtime qualification remain unrun."
  ]
